  "question": "Where\u2019s the closest university along the path connecting Muse Paintbar, Manchester, NH and Bunganut Town Park, Lyman, Me?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.461738 42.991047)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-70.698956 43.517295)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'university'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.461738 42.991047)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.461738 42.991047)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
